  unitName: Holy Geirdriful (EU)
  unitId: 760114
  unitNumber: 7036
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Although she is specialized
    in the fate of war chiefs and magicians in the afterlife, Geirdriful must take
    care of other fallen heroes to make up for her colleague's lack of commitment
    to the cause. Her wrath is ever growing, and with it her powers.
  summonDesc: A dark summoner you must be... Nice to meet you.
  fusionDesc: Thanks! You would be welcomed in our heaven.
  evoDesc: My dark magic is stronger than ever! You have my gratitude, summoner!
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
